Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, Joseph's\NBlood suits me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like it was meant to be\Nmine from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's far more intense than\Nanything I've ever felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sensation is absolutely incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A century ago, this body\Nbelonged to Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now these hands have feasted on\Nthe blood of his grandson, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was you, Jotaro, who\Nso thoughtfully led me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ancestor must be ruling in his grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Joestars have always been a nuisance,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I think the time has\Ncome to put you self
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-righteous cretins in your\Nproper place beneath my boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, in the end, Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.81,0:00:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would appear that the Joestar's destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is to facilitate my\Nascension to perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.21,0:01:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.61,0:01:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on, no matter what\NDio does to me, keep your cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.47,0:01:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempting as it may be, never allow\Nyourself to succumb to anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about my fate, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've accepted that it was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's his soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin deciphered the mystery of Dio's\Nstand, and I imparted that knowledge to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had we attacked Dio together\Nbefore learning his secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he would have been able\Nto easily kill all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You now have the ability to\Nmove while time is frozen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you only have two or three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:02:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you use that time wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.59,0:02:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't lose your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lose control, it'll only backfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your emotions in check\Nwhen you face off with Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite the journey, eh, my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.51,0:02:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An unforgettable adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.23,0:02:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our time together was a lot of fun.\NMore fun than I've had in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was real right hey,\Nwhat are you looking at?
