Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been sucked dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you said to keep my\Nemotions in check, but screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.01,0:03:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a person on the planet\Nwho can stay calm after seeing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight has come to an end.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.50,0:03:33.33,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
