Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I will. Nor did I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be абсолют.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a word on my\Nmind to find a boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it was the end, I'll be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the middle of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.93,0:04:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll Guild of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I live with a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now, what we are doing is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the last page of the last page?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,O la la la...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.11,0:04:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,O la la...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.30,0:05:11.43,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,475)\pos(132,890)\fs68\fscx90}Episode 48: Long Journey, Farewell, My Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring time to a halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second, two seconds,\Nand three seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now four!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five seconds. Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My power grows exponentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can stop time for even longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as for you, Jotaro, you wasted\Nthe opportunity you had to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gambling on getting me two seconds\Nbefore time resumed was all for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a miscalculation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could serenade the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I've dreamed of for\Nso long is finally upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight seconds have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been an immortal being\Nfor an entire century.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But never in my wildest\Ndreams could I have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,imagined I'd feel something\Nthis exhilarating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood of the Joe Stars\Ncourses through my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood of the Joe Stars\Ncourses through my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you were right after all, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stupid temper got me\Nin a shit ton of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He still hasn't faced the\Nfull force of my rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine seconds total.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how long my power\Nlasted just now. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps nine seconds is the new extent\Nof my stand's extraordinary power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to unleash all of my Stan's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, weren't you mumbling\Nsomething about being angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this all the power you possess?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I shall administer\Nthe killing blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is, my final dance with time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine more seconds,\Nthat's all you have left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro couldn't figure out why Dio had\Nsuddenly vanished amidst the standstill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he pushed the\Nthoughts out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what sinister\Nplot Dio was hatching?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what unholy tack\Nhe attempted to unleash?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro had only two seconds to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only two seconds to drive Star Platinum's\Nfists into Dio once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.65,0:08:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough\Nof this neon vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time I see that\Ngoddamn face of his,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to freaking lose it\Nand beat him into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.39,0:08:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to roll all over you!
