Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:08:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll obliterate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.87,0:09:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world has defeated Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is more powerful than his.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand power!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there is incontrovertible\Nproof that no one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on this miserable planet\Nis stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You loathsome humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall rule over your pathetic\Nspecies until the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now bow before my wisdom and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:09:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can stop time for ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've defeated Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should inspect his lifeless\Nbody and drink his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, if there's any\Nblood left to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that I'm slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I can't move at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.31,0:10:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible. I'm frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been 11 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's your stand's limit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stopped time at 9 seconds,\Nand it's a good thing I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gave me a chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're frozen like that,\Ndestroying you will only take a second.
