Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stop time, too? Curse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole act was a ruse to waste my\Nnine seconds, wasn't it, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it feel, Dio? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it feel having your arch enemy tower
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,behind you while you\Nstand frozen and helpless?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's a lot like holding\Nyour breath while underwater
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only someone's out to get you\Nand your air is running out as
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you desperately swim for your\Nlife. Then after finally reaching
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the surface and taking a breath\Nyou get pulled right back in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after everything you've done to me,\Nyou're not gonna get any sympathy from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:12:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is about to start moving again.
