Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compassion is something you're\Nnever gonna get from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't got any kindness for\Nyour sorry United ass though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit you look pretty pathetic\Nwrithing on the ground in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as i want to killing you like this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.11,0:12:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would leave a pretty\Nbad taste in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how long it'll\Ntake for you to heal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three seconds? Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the very moment your legs are healed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,star platinum's headed\Nyour way to demolish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this were the wild west\Nthe hero would say it's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,high noon now get off the\Nground and draw your peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.49,0:12:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio you're getting one shot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This insignificant whelp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare he mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.91,0:13:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I shouldn't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you would use this opportunity\Nto make such a human declaration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think like a true mortal, cursed with\Na fleeting life destined for obscurity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bad taste in your mouth, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, are you afraid\Nyou'd regret killing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reasoning is as\Npathetic as your species.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your foolish honor will be your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is where you and I differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My vision is clear and my mind\Nis focused on a single goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to dominate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.19,0:13:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more, nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing that\Nwill bring me fulfillment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how I go about doing that\Ndoesn't matter in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a little blood in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the immortal Dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.65,0:14:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the sun comes up,\Nyou'll be nothing but dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only made one mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that got you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, this whole thing might\Nhave ended differently, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and him pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.57,0:14:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it worth it?
