Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Speedwagon Foundation, car two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're traveling northbound\Non the Al Neal Expressway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we've retrieved Dio's remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I repeat, we've retrieved Dio's remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's body is showing cellular activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be exposed to\Nsunlight immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proceed with extreme caution. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noriyaki Kakyoin is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body is being transported now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jean-Pierre Polnareff is unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The medical staff of car one has him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Car two, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you placed the remains of Dio\Nand Joseph Joestar in the same car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio borrowed something from us. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we need to take it\Nback from the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not following your train of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to perform a blood\Ntransfusion between the two bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us to transfuse\NDio's blood into Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to bring him back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.87,0:16:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been all that long\Nsince Dio drained his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His upper half was destroyed in the\Nfight, but we'll take as much as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hurry, I think we can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Car One, did you catch\Nall that? Over, Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's impossible he doesn't\Neven have a pulse right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not to mention his heart\Nis stopped which means
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we couldn't circulate\Nhis blood if we wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't give me that you\Ncould call everything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've done on this journey\Nimpossible i'm tired of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hearing words like\Nimpossible or futile they all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mean nothing to us. You\Ncan do it if his heart's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beating, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Dio, I've already had a bit of\Npractice with stopping and starting hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear a pulse! Yes, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His heart is beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.43,0:17:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to transfuse his blood into Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might just be able to pull this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's completely regaining all its color.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His skin is filling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god, brain activity too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His vitals are stable as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He opened his eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it! He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a damn fool, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you've done is resurrect yours truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard! Wait! Calm down,\NJotaro! It was a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.67,0:18:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to get violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.51,0:18:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to have some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my word! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Joseph Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:19:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born September 27th in 1920!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wife's name is Suzy Q, and\NI collect comics as a hobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the leading actress\Nin Tarzan the Ape Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bo Derek!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now answer this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who sang Eat It, the spoof of Beat It?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.81,0:19:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird Al Yankovic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.57,0:19:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who else would know\Npointless crap like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Card, over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.59,0:19:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar is back with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's come back from the brink of death!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle! Over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've taken back everything\Nyou stole from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.09,0:20:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio took something\Nprecious from all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a hundred years, he's\Ntaken whatever he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His appetite for power\Nhas been insatiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taken far too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's taken things from us that\Nwe'll never be able to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.39,0:20:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The losses that we've endured on this\Njourney stretch as far as the planet itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thanks to their sacrifices,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're here to tell the tale\Nand carry on in their stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin. Iggy. Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're really going\Nback to France, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.49,0:21:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may be a bit forward,\Nbut your family's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come back\Nwith me to New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I know they're gone, but\NFrance is the only home I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's filled with memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a place I must return\Nto no matter where I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you ever need anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all you have to do is call and\NI'll be there in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna miss you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy, that's for damn sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I had a hell of a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm lucky to have been on\Nthis adventure with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're a team, and\Nthat's never gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling all passengers for\NFrance International Airlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flight 92 to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please proceed to gate 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, you ornery bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live long and happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you as moody grandson,\Nyou'd better not forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.31,0:22:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, of course, if you\Ndon't hate my guts by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.53,0:22:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stubborn jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't be able to forget about\Nyou, even if we wanted to, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Au River.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.09,0:22:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you sitting up\Nstraight all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.65,0:22:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to put it into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.99,0:22:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if we could\Nread each other's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:22:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, I can feel that\Nthey're coming home to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.47,0:23:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Polly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa and my Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.87,0:23:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming home!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.83,0:23:41.04,SC End,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(335,0)\pos(1632,789.2)}The End
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.71,0:24:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.31,0:24:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

